        "text": "Trade route automation (spec/systems/trade_routes.md func_041080/032914). A ship/wagon ferries cargo to Europe; on sale gross = qty * price, tax = gross*tax%/100 goes to the King's REF fund (PowerRecord+0x22), net = gross - tax credited to gold. Modeled: deliver qty (Constant) of a good at price.<good> with the live tax rate. FLAGGED: qty here is a Constant=100 stand-in for the route's loaded cargo."
